title: "Cover Shadow Value: measuring the value of cover shadows with tracking and body orientation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Melo
    given-names: Diogo
    affiliation: "Independent researcher"
date-released: 2026-11-09
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  Code that computes the Cover Shadow Value, a metric that values off-ball defensive
  positioning: a defender's body-orientation cone closes passing lanes, and that has value even
  without a tackle or an interception. Built on SkillCorner open data (tracking, events, body pose).
keywords:
  - football analytics
  - tracking data
  - body pose
  - defending
